UID:56a901d767765c975f810ccdd62173c38122026_2:21:30_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Illinois Tech Bible Club: Good Word Gathering
LOCATION:Rettaliata Engineering Center Room 034, 3201 South State Street, Chicago, Illinois 60616, United States
URL:https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=382770
DESCRIPTION:Come join the Illinois Tech Bible Club for our next Bible study! This semester's theme is Finding God in our Everyday. Each week, we'll explore what it means to lead in our community with the grace, wisdom, and love that God has shown us. Food will be provided! Whether you're brand new or have joined us before, we'd love to see you there!\n---\nEvent Details: https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=382770
END:VEVENT
