UID:12c8083eb78e3398be9df48ac60d683710222026_2:33:54_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:🦋 Level Up: Gaming Hour with Esports 🎮 
LOCATION:P-Club , 3201 South State Street, Chicago, Illinois 60616, United States
URL:https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385496
DESCRIPTION:📅 When: Thursday, November 12  \n🕐 12:50 – 1:50 PM   \n📍 Where: MTCC P-Club \n\nTake a break from the grind and jump into the action! We’re teaming up with Esports for an hour of gaming, competition, and free food. Grab some food, challenge your friends, or just hang out and spectate. \n\nFree food • Free play • Good vibes. Don’t miss it! \n\nSee you there! \n~ USA 🦋 \n---\nEvent Details: https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385496
END:VEVENT
