UID:48e90bc8af49872bdb89e66c81d0b35b10192026_9:08:31_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:DUI Litigation - Presentation from the CCSAO ASA Jake Mallory
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385365
DESCRIPTION:Ever wondered how prosecutors prove someone was impaired behind the wheel? Join the Criminal Law Society for a presentation by a Cook County prosecutor exploring the science behind DUI litigation. Learn how field forensic tools are used in DUI cases, how scientific evidence is challenged in court, and how evolving technology continues to shape the law. Discover how courts decide which scientific advancements can be trusted and what happens when the science is challenged.\n---\nEvent Details: https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385365
END:VEVENT
