DTSTART:20261111T160000Z
DTEND:20261113T000000Z
UID:3f6dd30aca7903d0710b2f3a763425821132026_10:44:36_AM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:FALL Class of 2026 Commencement Composite Photo Sign-Up
LOCATION:Room 760, 3201 South State Street, Chicago, Illinois 60616, United States
URL:https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385760
DESCRIPTION:SIGN UP HERE:  https://www.wejoinin.com/sheets/tenhv\n\nEach fall and spring semester, graduates are encouraged to have a composite photo taken to be part of law school history. If you've been to the 3rd floor, you've seen composite photos of the most recent class as well as classes all the way back to 1893. Now, it's your turn!\n\no	Use  sign up for a session on November 11-12, 2026 from 10 am - 6 pm in room 760, of the law school.\no	Up to three students may sign up for each 15-minute time slot. Time slots are given on a first-come, first-served basis; however, we request that those who can make a daytime spot leave the later sessions for evening students.\no	Deadline to sign up: Tuesday, November 10, 2026.\no	If you are unable to attend in November, dates in Spring will be announced. \n\nAnother date will be announced for the Class of 2027: Portraits are quick and free of charge. Digital images of your individual portrait and the composite photo will be provided free of charge, courtesy of the Alumni Association. Pricing details about purchasing prints of individual images and the composite photo will be available upon check-in with the photographers.\n\n\n\n---\nEvent Details: https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385760
END:VEVENT
