UID:272259a567812e419e99b6b1e51251f31132026_10:06:11_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:iGEM STEM Ideation & Recruitment
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385770
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of International STEM Week, Illinois Tech's iGEM team will host an informational and recruitment table at the MTCC. Students can learn about synthetic biology, explore our ongoing research projects, share ideas for future projects, and discover opportunities to join the team. We will also promote our upcoming general body meeting and encourage student involvement in interdisciplinary STEM research.\n---\nEvent Details: https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385770
END:VEVENT
