UID:5f1c278b547b112d77bee12ca6509b2c10262026_3:02:01_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Elevate Universe Tour: Elevate Portal Info Session
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385581
DESCRIPTION:Did you know you're part of the Elevate Universe?\n\nTap in and explore infinite possibilities!\n\nJoin us for a 45-minute virtual tour of the Elevate Portal (elevate.iit.edu) and discover the AI Career Coach.\n\nExplore how the Elevate Portal can help you:\n\nLEARN: Access career guides, resume resources, AI tools, and job search support.\n\nPRACTICE: Explore job simulations, virtual internships, and certifications.\n\nCONNECT: Connect with career coaches, alumni, employers, and career communities.\n\nPROVE: Showcase your achievements through badges and professional portfolios.\n\nDiscover the resources available to support your career journey through the Elevate Universe!\n---\nEvent Details: https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=385581
END:VEVENT
