UID:6cd7ebe5b36c97774759c18d5b2c00298122026_2:40:15_PM@campusgroups.com
SUMMARY;ENCODING=QUOTED-PRINTABLE:Illinois Tech Bible Club Welcome Night
LOCATION: Sign in to download the location
URL:https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=382774
DESCRIPTION:Kick off the semester with us at our first event of the year: Welcome Night! Join us at our Bible House for a night of free food, games, fellowship, and fun!\n\nCome meet our alumni and current members, get to know our community, learn more about who we are and what we do, and discover how you can get involved. Whether you’re already familiar with us or are meeting us for the first time, everyone is welcome!\n\nCome for the food, stay for the community—we can’t wait to meet you!\n---\nEvent Details: https://312.iit.edu/rsvp?id=382774
END:VEVENT
